# Sanjivani Citizen Mobile App Configuration
# Note: Physical mobile devices cannot access 'localhost'.
# Use your computer's local Wi-Fi / LAN IP (e.g. http://192.168.1.50:8000) when testing on a physical phone.
# When testing on Android Emulator, use http://10.0.2.2:8000.
# When testing in web browser or simulator, http://localhost:8000 works.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
